## [Ice Rink Game](https://atcoder.jp/contests/agc020/tasks/agc020_b)

倒序考虑即可。

```cpp
const int N = 1e5 + 7;
int n;
ll a[N], l = 2, r = 2;

int main() {
	rd(n), rda(a, n);
	for (int i = n; i; i--) {
		l = ((l - 1) / a[i] + 1) * a[i], r = r / a[i] * a[i];
